  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.44 Application Processing, Federal Registry, and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Appraisers Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.44 Application Processing, Federal Registry, and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Appraisers Board. The application-related fees found in Table 1002.44, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the real estate appraisers board under RSA 310-B:\n\nTable 1002.44 Application Processing, Federal Registry, and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Real Estate Appraisers Board\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nApprentice real estate appraiser application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nResidential appraiser certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nGeneral appraiser certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nResidential appraiser license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $275\n\nAnnual federal registry fee per RSA 310-B:5, II | 12 months | $40\n\nTemporary permit per RSA 310-B:12-a application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial - for single assignment | 6 months | $40\n\nOne-time renewal - to complete assignment | 6 months | $40\n\nAppraisal management company registration application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of registration baseline | up to 12 months | $880\n\nAdditional per appraiser who performed an appraisal for the company on a covered transaction within NH in the last year | up to 12 months | $25\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
